			"notes": "# Changelog\n- Added Emoji List (with Melinoe Emoji Support)\n- Added Region Switching when double clicking the Region\n- Added Pity for Repentance\n- Merged Player Currency and Status Title into a new Module called \"Nametag\"\n- Made width slider cap 20px now\n- Made Pity for clear mobs now only track if a dmg number was near it (indicates that you hit it, so +pity)\n- Fixed Hide Players still showing hitboxes \n- Fixed Peak DPS not being in Boss Stage Tracker \n- Fixed some Icons on Titles\n- Fixed dead links between client and server that made desyncs possible\n- Fixed Boss Stage Tracker on Warden, Herald, Reaper and Deimos"
		},
